                                                "sense_id": "247c28fa-fb83-367d-af40-85bfb8bbc86d",
                                                "text": "With the exception of the XML and doctype declarations, what's allowed in a document's epilog of miscellaneous information is exactly what's allowed in the prolog: comments and processing instructions"
