                                                "sense_id": "28f309f9-0293-30b2-8a72-2ff7f5e9cdc5",
                                                "text": "The “postamble” of the interim constitution reads: In order to advance such reconciliation and reconstruction, amnesty shall be granted in respect of acts, omissions and offences associated with political objectives […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b8e2a18f-c3ea-39f8-872d-b54e2a8f9c1d",
